attler, where you manage a hero's inventory to escape a haunted boardgame. Each run is different from the last, with unique upgrades, combos and synergies. Async PvP lets you battle the ghosts of other players at your own pace in this unique new inventory battler. Will your design outlive your ghostly opponents\u2026 or join them?", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/turnbound", "videos": [{"id": 165966, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "m2AWPM2BoFA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m2AWPM2BoFA", "title": "Turnbound Gameplay Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/m2AWPM2BoFA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 165973, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "Zx8ehPzwSrQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Zx8ehPzwSrQ", "title": "Turnbound - Gameplay Walkthrough Trailer | Galaxies Autumn 2025 Showcase", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Zx8ehPzwSrQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 163789, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "8OKXNyU13Jc", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8OKXNyU13Jc", "title": "Turnbound Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8OKXNyU13Jc/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 169958, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "gJCxOEpjc-g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gJCxOEpjc-g", "title": "Turnbound | BEST Indie Games Winter Showcase 2025 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/gJCxOEpjc-g/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 170779, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "mkGmCukxzgU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mkGmCukxzgU", "title": "Turnbound Release Date Announcement", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mkGmCukxzgU/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 174090, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "6AEjyj875ns", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6AEjyj875ns", "title": "Turnbound - Early Access Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/6AEjyj875ns/maxresdef